    <h2 style="text-align:center;">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 30/07/2025<br>
    <strong>Last Updated:</strong> 30/07/2025</p>

     <p>At Artender ("we", "our", or "us"), your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal information when you use our website and services. By accessing or using Artender.in, you agree to the practices described in this policy.</p>

    <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Full name, email address, phone number</li>
      <li>Profile photo, age, gender (if optionally provided)</li>
      <li>Uploaded artworks (images/videos) with metadata</li>
      <li>Payment details (UPI/card info via secure gateways, transaction ID)</li>
      <li>Device info, IP address, and usage activity</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Manage accounts and contest participation</li>
      <li>Process entry fee payments securely</li>
      <li>Display artworks and contest entries</li>
      <li>Send updates, announcements, and receipts</li>
      <li>Ensure content moderation and platform security</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>3. Data Sharing</h4>
    <p>Your data is never sold. We may share limited data only with trusted third-party services (e.g., payment processors) under strict confidentiality and security practices. Legal disclosures may be made if required under Indian law.</p>

    <h4>4. Your Rights</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal data</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications</li>
      <li>File complaints via the contact provided below</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>5. Data Retention</h4>
    <p>We retain data as long as necessary for legal, accounting, and operational purposes, including tax compliance and dispute resolution.</p>

    <h4>6. Security Measures</h4>
    <p>We employ SSL encryption, secure servers, access controls, and regular audits to protect your data. However, no system is completely secure. Users are responsible for using strong passwords.</p>

    <h4>7. Children’s Privacy</h4>
    <p>Users must be 13+ years old. Users under 18 require parental/guardian consent. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.</p>

    <h4>8. Payments & Third-Party Links</h4>
    <p>Payments are securely handled by third-party gateways. Artender does not store full card or banking info. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites linked from our platform.</p>

    <h4>9. Updates to This Policy</h4>
    <p>This policy may be updated periodically. Users will be notified of major changes via website alerts or email. Continued use implies acceptance.</p>

    <h4>10. Contact </h4>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> help.artender@gmail.com<br><strong>Address:</strong> Sishu Mandir Road, Dindori, 481880</p>

    <h4>11. Governing Law</h4>
    <p>This policy is governed by Indian law. Disputes fall under the jurisdiction of the courts in Dindori, Madhya Pradesh</p>
