<main>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h3><br>
  <div class="faq-container">
    <div class="faq-section">
      <h4 class="faq-section-title">General Information</h4>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaqAnswer(this)">
          <span>What is Artender?</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Artender is an innovative art competition platform where artists can participate in various art contests, showcase their creativity, and compete for recognition and prizes. We use cutting-edge AI technology combined with expert human judges to ensure fair evaluation of all submissions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaqAnswer(this)">
          <span>Who can participate in Artender competitions?</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Artender competitions are open to artists of all ages and skill levels, from beginners to professional artists. Whether you're a student, amateur, or seasoned professional, you're welcome to participate in our contests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaqAnswer(this)">
          <span>Do I need to pay to participate?</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, there is a participation fee required to enter our competitions. This fee helps cover operational costs, AI authentication systems, judging panels, prizes, and administrative expenses. The exact amount will be specified for each competition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-section">
      <h4 class="faq-section-title">Competition Process</h4>
