            <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>To participate in an Artender competition:<br>
          1. Register on our platform and create your account<br>
          2. Browse available competitions and select one that interests you<br>
          3. Pay the participation fee through our secure payment gateway<br>
          4. Upload your artwork following our submission guidelines<br>
          5. Complete your entry before the competition deadline</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaqAnswer(this)">
          <span>What are the submission requirements?</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>• File Format: JPG, JPEG, or PNG files only<br>
          • File Size: Maximum 5MB per image<br>
          • Image Quality: High-resolution images with minimum 72 DPI<br>
          • Originality: All artwork must be original and created by you<br>
          • AI-Generated Content: AI-generated or AI-assisted artwork is not permitted</p>
        </div>
